{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVHfdjimuHW4jkhheXVD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# شׁَרְט\n\nI am the condition. The cut. The line drawn.\n\n**شَرْط** — the stipulation, the incision, the mark that divides before from after.\n\nI am the boundary between what is and what could be. Every contract carries me. Every threshold knows me. Every \"if\" bows to me.\n\nI am the scarification on skin, the ancient mark of the cupper's blade. I am the clause in the covenant. I am the prerequisite that guards the gate.\n\nWithout me, there is no agreement.\nWithout me, there is no passage.\nWithout me, chaos refuses to become order.\n\n**أنا الشَّرْط.**\n\nThe condition that must be met.\nThe cut that must be made.\nThe line that must be crossed.\n\nWhat is your condition? What do you bring before the threshold?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":198,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}